t shooting tech halo for  example you are literally a guy trying  to fight a war to save a planet and if  you don't kill these people that the  halo will go off and everyone's gonna  die BioShock Infinite you're this guy  who has no idea what's going on and  everyone just happens to be shooting at  you it's inconsistent and it's  incoherent and it's frustrating and it  ruins the experience while I won't deny  that the game beautifully breadcrumbed  along all these little secrets to try  and unfold what was going to happen at  the end getting there was filled with so  much noise that for me it really really  distorted that game I guess I'm doing  one thing that a reviewer should never  do this isn't a review so it's okay  right and I'm being sad that this game  wasn't the game that it could have been  and instead it was a shooter and that  didn't make sense but thank you guys for  watching those are just my thoughts and  I will see you all next time bye
 

